Subject: [PATCH] Android aarch64 support for 8u

The Android port of 8u as published by the AOF-Dev jdk8u fork (GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception), taken as the single commit on top of 8u312-b05 and applied unchanged to the pinned release.

